---
<BaseLayout
  title="Idea 库 — 做 subnet — OpenTAO"
  description="一份可用的 subnet 方向目录,都先用我们评估每个申请者的四个 lens 过过筛。"
  section="build"
>
  <SubNav items={subnav} active="/build/idea-bank" rightMeta="12 个开放 · 每周刷新" />

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b hairline">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-grid opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
      <Breadcrumb crumbs={[
        { href: '/zh/', label: 'OpenTAO' },
        { href: '/build/hackathon', label: '做 subnet' },
        { label: 'Idea 库' },
      ]} />

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="accent-dot"></span>
        <span class="section-label" style="color: #b8470b">开放问题 · 预筛过 · 未被认领</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-[60px] md:text-[72px] leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.03em] font-semibold max-w-[920px]">
        十二个<br><span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)]">还不存在的 subnet。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 text-lg text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] leading-relaxed">
        一份可用的 subnet 方向目录。每一条都有一个 crypto 之外的明确买家、随 GPU 线性扩展、并扛得住最明显的作弊——都用我们评估每个申请者的四个 lens 压测过。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] leading-relaxed">
        挑一个。偷一个。拼两个。这个库就是用来被搬空的。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a href="#catalog" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-md">浏览目录<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#vetting" class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium px-5 py-3 rounded-md">我们怎么筛 idea →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-6 gap-2 max-w-3xl text-center">
        {domainCounts.map((d) => (
          <div class="border hairline rounded-md py-3">
            <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">{d.code}</div>
            <div class="font-semibold mt-1">{d.n}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="catalog" class="border-b hairline scroll-mt-16">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-16">

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {filters.map((f) => (
            <button class={`filter-btn ${f.active ? 'active' : ''}`} data-filter-domain={f.domain}>{f.label}</button>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">
          <span>排序</span>
          <select id="idea-sort" class="bg-transparent border hairline rounded px-2 py-1 text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">
            <option value="heat">买家就绪度</option>
            <option value="recent">最近添加</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4" id="idea-grid">
        {ideas.map((idea, i) => (
          <article class="card rounded-md p-7" data-domain={idea.domain} data-heat={idea.heat} data-order={i}>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-3">
              <span class="domain-tag" style={domainStyles[idea.domain]}>{idea.domain}</span>
              <span class="heat text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">买家就绪 <span class="heat-bar"><span style={`width: ${idea.heat}%`}></span></span></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2 leading-snug">{idea.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-5">{idea.body}</p>
            <div class="idea-row">
              {idea.rowA.map((c) => (
                <div><div class="k">{c.k}</div>{c.v}</div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="idea-row">
              {idea.rowB.map((c) => (
                <div>
                  <div class="k">{c.k}</div>
                  {c.scaling && <><span class="check-pill check-ok">✓ {c.scaling}</span> </>}{c.v}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] gap-6 items-stretch">
        <div class="card stripe rounded-md p-7">
          <div class="section-label mb-3" style="color: #b8470b;">有别的 idea?</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3 leading-snug">用四个 lens 过一遍。活下来,就提交。</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-5">
            这个目录是起点,不是围栏。今天最好的那些 subnet,大多一年前不在任何人的清单上。如果你有一个 compute-bound、且在 crypto 之外有真实买家的东西,我们想看。
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <a href="/zh/build/hackathon" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-md">提交到黑客松<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
            <a href="#vetting" class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">读读四个 lens →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded-md p-7">
          <div class="section-label mb-3">我们会礼貌谢绝的</div>
          <ul class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed space-y-2.5">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs mt-0.5">×</span><span><strong class="text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">"crypto 原生"工具。</strong>买家得活在 crypto 之外。</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs mt-0.5">×</span><span><strong class="text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">人速产出。</strong>标注工厂、零工派单。</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs mt-0.5">×</span><span><strong class="text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">API 转卖 subnet。</strong>miner 只是代理一个前沿模型。</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs mt-0.5">×</span><span><strong class="text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">主观打分。</strong>Yuma 不收敛,emission 被砍。</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="vetting" class="vetting-section border-b hairline scroll-mt-16">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20">

      <div class="mb-14 max-w-[680px]">
        <div class="section-label mb-3" style="color: #b8470b;">我们怎么筛 idea</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4 leading-[1.05]">
          <span class="font-serif italic text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] font-normal">上面每一条</span><br>背后的评分标准。
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          库里每个 idea 在被收进来前都过了这四个 lens。你带自己的来,同样的 lens 也适用——评委会从这里开始看。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="section-label mb-3">四个 lens</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-10 max-w-[640px]">四个问题。写代码前,诚实地回答。</h3>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {lenses.map((l) => (
            <div class="lens">
              <div class="lens-num mb-3">{l.n}</div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3">{l.title}</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-5">{l.body}</p>
              <div class="border-t hairline pt-4 mt-auto">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-2">好的回答长这样</div>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">{l.good}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="section-label mb-3">解剖</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3 max-w-[640px]">上面每一条都填满三列。</h3>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          如果这三列你没法各用三句话填好,这个设计还没准备好。模糊的列产出模糊的代码,模糊的代码产出"有 emission、没买家"。
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="anatomy-col">
            <header>Miner 的活</header>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">miner 产出什么</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">每个挑战一个定义清晰的输出。不是"给 X 做 AI"——而是"给定 prompt P,返回带字段 A、B、C 的 JSON"。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="anatomy-col" style="border-color: rgba(184,71,11,0.3); background: rgba(184,71,11,0.03);">
            <header>Validator 打分</header>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">"好"怎么量</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">一个从(miner 输出, ground truth)到标量的确定性函数。如果两个 validator 的分歧超过噪声,subnet 就不会收敛。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="anatomy-col">
            <header>市场出口</header>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-base mb-2">谁消费这个产出</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">从链上产出到美元收入的路径。没有它,emission 是唯一付钱方,subnet 就是套了 Python 壳的 Ponzi。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="section-label mb-3">算力测试</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3 max-w-[640px]">GPU 翻倍,产出翻倍吗?</h3>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          这是最有用的单项测试。拿你的草稿 idea 套一下,体会那个答案。
        </p>

        <div class="lens mb-8">
          <div class="lens-num mb-4">一个实例——语言数据标注</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            两个版本。版本 A 让 miner 去招标注员。版本 B 让 miner 跑一个模型,给买家提供的数据集打分。
          </p>

          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="pill no">版本 A — 人速绑定</span></div>
              {computeRowsA.map((r) => (
                <div class="compute-row">
                  <span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs">{r.g}</span>
                  <div class="bar"><span style={`width: ${r.w}%`}></span></div>
                  <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">{r.t}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
              <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] mt-4 leading-relaxed">产出被标注员速度卡住。GPU 闲着。emission 出去了,活没回来。<span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">L2 不过关。</span></p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="pill ok">版本 B — compute-bound</span></div>
              {computeRowsB.map((r) => (
                <div class="compute-row">
                  <span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] font-mono text-xs">{r.g}</span>
                  <div class="bar"><span style={`width: ${r.w}%`}></span></div>
                  <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">{r.t}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
              <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] mt-4 leading-relaxed">每张 GPU 端到端跑一个 eval 模型。买家在自己那边采语料。<span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">L2 过关。</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rail">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed italic font-serif text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)]">
            数据采集本身可以很有价值——但它属于 subnet <em>之外</em>,在买家那边或一个单独的聚合器里。subnet 内部,唯一随 miner 槽位线性扩展的,是 GPU 能干的事。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="section-label mb-3">常见死法</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-10 max-w-[640px]">subnet 悄悄死掉的六种方式。</h3>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
          {failures.map((f) => (
            <div class="fail-card">
              <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-2">{f.code}</div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">{f.title}</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">{f.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="section-label mb-3">参考 subnet</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3 max-w-[640px]">三个已经过了评分标准的在线 subnet。</h3>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] mb-10 leading-relaxed">把它们当尸检报告读——买家是谁、GPU 实际在干嘛、verifier 在 replay 什么?</p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
          {refSubnets.map((s) => (
            <a href={`/beginner/subnets/${s.slug}`} class="card rounded-md p-5 block">
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-2">netuid {s.netuid} · 在线</div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">{s.name}</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">{s.body}</p>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="section-label mb-3">申请前</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3 max-w-[640px]">你应该能写出的那一页纸。</h3>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-[640px] mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          如果这 8 行你都能用大白话填满,你就可以上黑客松或孵化器了。如果还有两行在打太极,先把它们解决掉。
        </p>

        <div class="border hairline rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--color-paper)]">
          {onePager.map((row, i) => (
            <div class={`grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] ${i < onePager.length - 1 ? 'border-b hairline' : ''}`}>
              <div class="bg-[color:var(--color-surface)] p-4 text-xs font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)] border-r hairline">{row.n}</div>
              <div class="p-4 text-sm">{row.v}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/build/hackathon" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-md">带去黑客松<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
          <a href="/zh/build/incubator" class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium px-5 py-3 rounded-md">或者申请孵化器</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const grid = document.getElementById('idea-grid');
    const cards = grid ? Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('article[data-domain]')) : [];
    let domain = 'all';

    function render() {
      if (!grid) return;
      const sortSel = document.getElementById('idea-sort') as HTMLSelectElement | null;
      const mode = sortSel?.value || 'heat';
      const sorted = [...cards].sort((a, b) => {
        if (mode === 'heat') return Number(b.dataset.heat) - Number(a.dataset.heat);
        return Number(a.dataset.order) - Number(b.dataset.order);
      });
      for (const c of sorted) grid.appendChild(c);
      for (const c of cards) {
        const match = domain === 'all' || c.dataset.domain === domain;
        c.style.display = match ? '' : 'none';
      }
    }

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter-domain]').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        domain = btn.dataset.filterDomain || 'all';
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter-domain]').forEach((b) => b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn));
        render();
      });
    });
    document.getElementById('idea-sort')?.addEventListener('change', render);
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lens { border: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 24px; background: #ffffff; }
  .lens-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #b8470b; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.1); }
  .pill.ok { background: rgba(21,128,61,0.06); color: #15803d; border-color: rgba(21,128,61,0.2); }
  .pill.no { background: rgba(184,28,28,0.05); color: #b91c1c; border-color: rgba(184,28,28,0.2); }
  .rail { border-left: 2px solid rgba(184,71,11,0.18); padding-left: 20px; }
  .anatomy-col { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.08); border-radius: 6px; background: #ffffff; }
  .anatomy-col header { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #b8470b; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .compute-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr 80px; gap: 16px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.06); font-size: 14px; }
  .compute-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .bar { height: 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(184,71,11,0.18); }
  .bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: #b8470b; }
  .fail-card { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.08); border-radius: 6px; background: #fafaf9; }
  .filter-btn { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 7px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.12); border-radius: 999px; color: #4a4a52; transition: all .15s; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; }
  .filter-btn:hover { color: #0c0c10; border-color: rgba(15,15,18,0.3); }
  .filter-btn.active { background: #0c0c10; color: #ffffff; border-color: #0c0c10; }
  .domain-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .heat { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .heat-bar { display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 36px; height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; background: rgba(15,15,18,0.08); margin-left: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .heat-bar > span { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; background: #b8470b; }
  .idea-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(15,15,18,0.06); font-size: 13px; }
  .idea-row .k { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #767680; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .check-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; }
  .check-ok { background: rgba(21,128,61,0.08); color: #15803d; }
  .vetting-section { background: #fafaf9; }
</style>
